{"title":"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>The three angles in a triangle are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/6/f166f3da2cd28434487b685f4926471aa81d5d80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f415427053788f68f640a1f62088e2798b09f824.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/9/da9bb652e84532a7cddad7b633cb769bc6946d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ}$\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" />. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the interior angles in any triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cf86b308d3e7e2925a2081bb4acc7fe66cade7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} + 25^{\\circ} + N^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"173\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/f/bcfe14e6c0ffd1c6793e8ec0331eae825e58cf63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ} - 25^{\\circ} - N^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"173\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/8/bc8dcaf5709c8c58e73ff7ef8713b7094e7b9856.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 155 - N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2\">player 2</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c85834dcba3b386ffbc2be2f35355440d42ee95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />. This means:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/f/4cf6bd3778dbfa78a470ed4c14e7de75135e78c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 155 - 35 = \\boxed{120}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"167\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC\">2025 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 2\">Practice Relay Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 4\">Practice Relay Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2025 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_TUC_